This product contains work derived from the following projects:

* Apache FOP (https://xmlgraphics.apache.org/fop/), Apache License 2.0.
  internal/fo ports parts of FOP's layout (line and page breaking, property
  handling). Apache FOP's own notice:

      Apache FOP
