      This product includes software developed at
      The Apache Software Foundation (http://www.apache.org/).

* Flying Saucer (https://github.com/flyingsaucerproject/flyingsaucer),
  GNU LGPL 2.1 or later. internal/xhr ports its layout and rendering, and
  internal/xhr/ua.css is derived from its default user agent style sheet.

* OpenJDK (https://openjdk.org/), GPL 2.0 with the Classpath Exception.
  internal/xhr/linebreak.bin holds the line break state tables of
  java.text.BreakIterator, extracted so that text wraps exactly as on the JVM.

* Adobe Core 14 AFM font metrics (as distributed with iText 5): glyph widths
  and metrics in internal/xhr/base14_gen.go. Adobe permits use, copying and
  distribution of these metric files for any purpose.

* Liberation Fonts (https://github.com/liberationfonts), SIL Open Font
  License 1.1: the fonts in internal/font/data, see
  internal/font/data/LICENSE-Liberation.txt.

The PDF output emulates the conventions of iText 5 (number formatting,
clipping and fill geometry) for byte-level compatibility; no iText source
code is included.
